1. `20260822041944_00_set_updated_at_function.sql` - Trigger helper
2. `20260822041835_01_is_admin_helper.sql` - Role check function
3. `20260822041847_02_profiles_table.sql` - Auth profile references
4. `20260822041900_03_employees_table.sql` - Employee records
5. `20260822041912_04_attendance_table.sql` - Attendance logs
6. `20260822041924_05_leave_requests_table.sql` - Leave management
7. `20260822041935_06_payroll_table.sql` - Salary structures
8. `20260822050000_10_audit_logs_table.sql` - Audit trail
9. `20260822060000_11_announcements_table.sql` - Announcements table
10. `20260822070000_12_leave_balances_table.sql` - Quotas & balances
11. `20260822080000_13_holidays_calendar_table.sql` - Public holidays
12. `20260822090000_14_stored_procedures.sql` - Analytical RPCs
13. `20260822100000_15_deduct_leave_trigger.sql` - Automatic deduction trigger
14. `20260822110000_16_performance_indexes.sql` - Indexing
15. `20260822120000_17_realtime_publication.sql` - Realtime channels
